_msg_id":"5634f1bb-a409-4fa6-8159-1495a88706bd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339217.html\u003e\nほどほどバカでほどほど安全(1つ1つは)なのでわりと好きw","ts":"1626750034.489400","attachments":[{"fallback":"PC Watch: 16台まで合体、最大1,600W出力できるType-C充電器","id":1,"title":"16台まで合体、最大1,600W出力できるType-C充電器","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339217.html","text":"　HYPERは19日(米国時間)、最大1,500Wまで対応するコンセントを備えたマルチポートType-C充電器2モデルを発表した。65W出力の3ポート充電器と100W出力の4ポート充電器の2タイプで、いずれもGaN(窒素ガリウム)を半導体に使用したコンパクトな充電器。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1339/217/01.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1626728400,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339217.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339217.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+0Npg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eb86370-74b9-473e-b8c9-bbb3179c5934","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そういえば自宅にどういうわけかドルチェグストが生えてきたんですが、なかなか美味しいですねあれ （ \u003c#CCLJFJ58F|hobby-gourmet\u003e と迷った）","ts":"1626747333.488700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U81LLJ340","UD1FQV38V","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SHIu8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eedaa796-634d-408a-8908-038d753ced6c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"かな...","ts":"1626745458.486600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kIrK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd325304-adbb-4de4-a793-2b9775871e05","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"冷房停止後に一定時間自動で送風運転する機能、あれは素晴らしい。","ts":"1626745443.486400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626745469.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZrrS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"015cef3b-c57f-49cf-97de-42713446bc5d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやメーカーはそんなこと考えてないと思う。と単価を上げるための方策として採用され、一社が採用したから他の会社も…みたいなテンプレでしょ。","ts":"1626745386.485500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WAN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"883ea85d-3095-4897-b5bd-5c7c0ac1a2ca","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"もちろん、ただ日常でフィルタ上にあるホコリをどれだけの量、どれだけの影響の見るかですかね\nメーカーは「みんなわりとズボラだし影響大」と見たってところかな...まあちゃんとする気ならないほうがいいのは了解","ts":"1626744809.484400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0F2nw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7050D3EB-424C-415A-A605-938B51B34E6B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"だって、自動清掃あるからって、ホコリが消滅するわけじゃないですよね。","ts":"1626744702.483200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eB6=Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5C15622A-9C0D-4270-AB23-06D126E4B5E7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"感覚的には自動清掃機能ありとなしで、\n本当に何もメンテしなければ自動清掃の方が長持ちなんだろうけど、なしの方が1回でもメンテしたら寿命が逆転するくらいのイメージ。\nなので、自動清掃機能なしで業者依頼するのが良いと思ってる","ts":"1626744651.482400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dIoo8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52ce9f1f-c4bb-4c5b-bb1a-34a9d2b8f25c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあそうですね、メンテちゃんとできるならそっちがラクですよねw","ts":"1626744547.479800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X09"}]},{"client_msg_id":"566cdf8b-0682-4cae-8278-514c9093f9d4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"無理矢理たとえるなら、それなりの規模があるCMakefileをメンテするのとMakefileをメンテするのどっちがマシか、みたいな。ちなみにMakefile(通常のフィルタ)はシャワーで流せば済むくらいの手間でメンテできることがわかってる前提。","ts":"1626744326.478400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jtYf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d5e56a6-fc1e-4a81-b436-54c7d0e27e77","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど","ts":"1626744182.476700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hezg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3babc246-d493-40df-ac56-9c296fa730f4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやそれを考慮しても「なし」ですね。ぼくは。","ts":"1626744151.476300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OJk9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18933ff1-3494-4044-89a5-78d414ce6b3f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普段のフィルタ掃除さぼりがち(自分の部屋じゃないけど)ので、あるならあるほうがみたいなのもなくはなく...かなあ","ts":"1626744131.476000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mj8YM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24199045-4111-458b-afb5-b563b83ee575","type":"message","user":"U01GH1TRL7N","text":"お掃除機能付きだと業者に頼むときに追加でお金がかかるのでつらそう お掃除本舗だと +8800円となかなかのお値段…\n\u003chttps://www.osoujihonpo.com/house-cleaning/aircon/\u003e","ts":"1626744003.475200","attachments":[{"fallback":"おそうじ本舗: エアコンクリーニング | お掃除のことならおそうじ本舗","id":1,"title":"エアコンクリーニング | お掃除のことならおそうじ本舗","title_link":"https://www.osoujihonpo.com/house-cleaning/aircon/","text":"エアコンクリーニングなら全国で展開中のおそうじ本舗にお任せ！壁掛け／埋め込みタイプからお掃除機能付きエアコンまで、掃除のプロが徹底的に汚れを除去。","image_url":"https://cdn.osoujihonpo.com/images/front/common/ogp_logo.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"おそうじ本舗","service_icon":"https://www.osoujihonpo.com/favicon/apple-touch-icon-57x57.png","from_url":"https://www.osoujihonpo.com/house-cleaning/aircon/","original_url":"https://www.osoujihonpo.com/house-cleaning/aircon/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8BPY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db0803f5-4937-468a-8965-23b467986705","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"自動清掃機能は、本来不要な機能を付けてアップセルとして売る戦略って感じがしますよね。","ts":"1626744001.475100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U8CC7